# Q56 What does it replace: each data object that takes the place of a data object on an earlier platform, with both names and the design of the new one where it has one.
PREFIX tg: <https://w3id.org/mpc/ontology/modules/technical-graph/>
SELECT ?object ?name ?replaced ?replacedName ?design WHERE {
  ?object tg:replaces ?replaced ;
          tg:name ?name .
  ?replaced tg:name ?replacedName .
  OPTIONAL { ?object tg:designedAs ?design }
}
